{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564990/extras/5f63a9c7bd86b22a0fd16e3f1a68e6c5.poster.avif?t=1772803843\" width=1170 height=412 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564990/extras/5f63a9c7bd86b22a0fd16e3f1a68e6c5.webm?t=1772803843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564990/extras/5f63a9c7bd86b22a0fd16e3f1a68e6c5.mp4?t=1772803843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Vale's Echo is a 2D cozy horror adventure game blending dark comedy, psychological themes, and surreal art.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vale died. Then the underworld called and said, \u201cWelcome to your problems, part two.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She wakes up on a train to nowhere. No pulse. No past. No clue. Her only company? Echo - a floating skull full of secrets, charm, and just the right amount of mischief. But the underworld isn\u2019t empty. The landlord is a leech. Literally. The hermit thinks you\u2019d taste great with salt. And somewhere in the dark, every fear Vale ever buried is waiting to say hello.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564990/extras/f8f185d76dc814328e9949699f9f9add.avif?t=1772803843\" width=1170 height=136 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564990/extras/f00e4e27dcf4485192f11e1c5ba271a6.avif?t=1772803843\" width=1170 height=82 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Branching dialogue and meaningful choices weave her relationships, memories, and ultimate ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564990/extras/60412c88dc72057977478d4157806494.poster.avif?t=1772803843\" width=1170 height=412 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564990/extras/60412c88dc72057977478d4157806494.webm?t=1772803843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564990/extras/60412c88dc72057977478d4157806494.mp4?t=1772803843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564990/extras/13dc2d256ef84f07d55b77c5c7f7be9c.avif?t=1772803843\" width=1170 height=82 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Cook an unearthly dinner for a hungry hermit, unlock cursed luggage, and outwit the underworld\u2019s strange logic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564990/extras/fba8d3692829cde708b9d2879abc9e37.poster.avif?t=1772803843\" width=1170 height=412 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564990/extras/fba8d3692829cde708b9d2879abc9e37.webm?t=1772803843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564990/extras/fba8d3692829cde708b9d2879abc9e37.mp4?t=1772803843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564990/extras/58411d0d594c4dc4c3784567fa089904.avif?t=1772803843\" width=1170 height=82 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">They may have crooked teeth. They might bite. Try anyway.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564990/extras/6d3f43f85696ca604a219d2340a61147.poster.avif?t=1772803843\" width=1170 height=412 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564990/extras/6d3f43f85696ca604a219d2340a61147.webm?t=1772803843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564990/extras/6d3f43f85696ca604a219d2340a61147.mp4?t=1772803843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564990/extras/517576e94a559c624e466b143054b64e.avif?t=1772803843\" width=1170 height=82 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Bargain with leeches, chat with fish-human hybrids, and meet creatures who test your morals - and your sense of humor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564990/extras/de810a068c4c3c4b90e8893f99e467fa.poster.avif?t=1772803843\" width=1170 height=412 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564990/extras/de810a068c4c3c4b90e8893f99e467fa.webm?t=1772803843\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564990/extras/de810a068c4c3c4b90e8893f99e467fa.mp4?t=1772803843\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Seek peace\u2026 or don\u2019t. Some truths are worse than dying.</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\">